-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §146: the pay of an intern whose internship
-- year is his last year of study, and in the year after it — 90% of a
-- beginning B.A. teacher's salary for one who finished 80% of years 1–3,
-- an uncertified teacher's for one who did not; the next year a B.A.
-- teacher's to the end of March, kept if he shows his degree and
-- certificate by then, and taken back to the intern's pay if not; and never
-- more than two years an intern.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `146`

-- akn:art_146 The section's heading line: the pay of an intern whose internship year is his last year of study, and in the year after it.

DECLARE `intern's pay` IS ONE OF
    `an intern's pay: 90% of a beginning B.A. teacher's, grade 1, seniority 0`
    `an uncertified reform teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`
    `a B.A. teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`

`the intern's share of a beginning teacher's pay` MEANS 90%

-- ¶2: the internship year is the last year of study (the fourth at a
-- college of education, the second of the teaching-certificate studies at a
-- university). (1): 80% or more of the duties of years 1–3 done — the
-- intern's pay; (2): less — an uncertified reform teacher's pay for the
-- year; after it, (3) if he finished years 1–4, and if not the uncertified
-- teacher's pay on, for two years at most.
@ref akn:art_146/p2 akn:art_146__para_1 akn:art_146__para_2
GIVEN `share of the duties of years 1-3 done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `intern's pay`
DECIDE `pay in the internship year` `share of the duties of years 1-3 done` IS
    IF `share of the duties of years 1-3 done` AT LEAST 0.8
    THEN `an intern's pay: 90% of a beginning B.A. teacher's, grade 1, seniority 0`
    ELSE `an uncertified reform teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`

GIVEN `beginning B.A. teacher's pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the intern's pay` `beginning B.A. teacher's pay` IS
    `the intern's share of a beginning teacher's pay` TIMES `beginning B.A. teacher's pay`

-- (3)(א)–(ד): the year after a successful internship year, having finished
-- 80% of the duties of years 1–4: a B.A. teacher's pay to the end of March;
-- shown his entitlement to the degree and certificate by then, he is on the
-- B.A. table and the year counts for seniority and promotion; not entitled
-- by then, the intern's pay from the start of the year, the difference for
-- the months paid as a B.A. teacher deducted, by the period and the
-- position; entitled but not shown, the same until he shows it, then
-- corrected back.
@ref akn:art_146__para_3 akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_a akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_b akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_c akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_d
GIVEN `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` IS A BOOLEAN
      `showed it by the end of March` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `intern's pay`
DECIDE `pay in the year after the internship` `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` `showed it by the end of March` IS
    IF `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` AND `showed it by the end of March`
    THEN `a B.A. teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`
    ELSE `an intern's pay: 90% of a beginning B.A. teacher's, grade 1, seniority 0`

GIVEN `B.A. pay` IS A NUMBER, `intern's pay` IS A NUMBER, `months paid as a B.A. teacher` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference deducted` `B.A. pay` `intern's pay` `months paid as a B.A. teacher` `position fraction` IS
    (`B.A. pay` MINUS `intern's pay`) TIMES `months paid as a B.A. teacher` TIMES `position fraction`

DECLARE `section 146 action` IS ONE OF `give the intern written notice of (ב)–(ד)`

-- (ה): written personal notice of (ב)–(ד) by 1 September of that school
-- year. Time is in days from that day.
@ref akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_e
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 146 action`
DECIDE `the notice to the intern` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `give the intern written notice of (ב)–(ד)`
    WITHIN 0
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 146(3)(ה): personal written notice by 1 September"

-- (ו)–(ז): an intern's pay until he shows the entitlement, but never beyond
-- two years from the start of the internship; no one is an intern on an
-- intern's pay more than two years.
@ref akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_f akn:art_146__para_3__subpara_g
`years an intern's pay may last at most` MEANS 2

GIVEN `years since the internship began` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may still be paid as an intern` `years since the internship began` IF
    `years since the internship began` LESS THAN `years an intern's pay may last at most`

#ASSERT `pay in the internship year` 0.8 EQUALS `an intern's pay: 90% of a beginning B.A. teacher's, grade 1, seniority 0`
#ASSERT `pay in the internship year` 0.7 EQUALS `an uncertified reform teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`
#ASSERT `the intern's pay` 7000 EQUALS 6300
#ASSERT `pay in the year after the internship` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `an intern's pay: 90% of a beginning B.A. teacher's, grade 1, seniority 0`
-- Paid as a B.A. teacher September to March (7 months) at 80%, not
-- entitled: 7 × 700 × 0.8 is taken back.
#ASSERT `the difference deducted` 7000 6300 7 0.8 EQUALS 3920
#ASSERT NOT `may still be paid as an intern` 2
